Description: Iterate the driver dict with two variables under meson 1.12
 Meson 1.12 rejects a single variable over a dict in foreach ("Foreach
 expects exactly 2 variables"). Fedora 45 ships 1.12, and with
 introspection disabled the else-branch below is always evaluated, so the
 build fails before compiling anything. The key is the test name; the
 value is the per-driver configuration dict.
Author: piano mainline contributors

diff --git a/tests/meson.build b/tests/meson.build
--- a/tests/meson.build
+++ b/tests/meson.build
@@ -292,7 +292,7 @@
         args: ['-c', 'exit 77']
     )
 
-    foreach driver_test: drivers_tests
+    foreach driver_test, driver_test_args: drivers_tests
         test(driver_test,
             sh,
             args: ['-c', 'exit 77']
